{"dur": 28.58, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Une poutre : trente sur soixante, portée cinq mètres quarante.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 5.084, "words": [{"w": "Une", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "poutre", "t": 1.459}, {"w": ":", "t": 1.912}, {"w": "trente", "t": 1.977}, {"w": "sur", "t": 2.43}, {"w": "soixante,", "t": 2.689}, {"w": "portée", "t": 3.271}, {"w": "cinq", "t": 3.725}, {"w": "mètres", "t": 4.048}, {"w": "quarante.", "t": 4.501}]}, {"id": "compte", "text": "Combien de temps pour la ferrailler ? Réponds dans ta tête.", "t0": 5.464, "t1": 8.593, "words": [{"w": "Combien", "t": 5.464}, {"w": "de", "t": 5.896}, {"w": "temps", "t": 6.058}, {"w": "pour", "t": 6.381}, {"w": "la", "t": 6.651}, {"w": "ferrailler", "t": 6.813}, {"w": "?", "t": 7.406}, {"w": "Réponds", "t": 7.46}, {"w": "dans", "t": 7.892}, {"w": "ta", "t": 8.162}, {"w": "tête.", "t": 8.324}]}, {"id": "verdict", "text": "À la main ? Entre trente minutes et une heure. Sans te tromper.", "t0": 11.793, "t1": 15.692, "words": [{"w": "À", "t": 11.793}, {"w": "la", "t": 11.921}, {"w": "main", "t": 12.113}, {"w": "?", "t": 12.432}, {"w": "Entre", "t": 12.496}, {"w": "trente", "t": 12.88}, {"w": "minutes", "t": 13.327}, {"w": "et", "t": 13.838}, {"w": "une", "t": 14.03}, {"w": "heure.", "t": 14.286}, {"w": "Sans", "t": 14.669}, {"w": "te", "t": 14.989}, {"w": "tromper.", "t": 15.18}]}, {"id": "twist", "text": "Et si ça tenait… dans le temps d'un café ?", "t0": 16.072, "t1": 18.2, "words": [{"w": "Et", "t": 16.072}, {"w": "si", "t": 16.208}, {"w": "ça", "t": 16.343}, {"w": "tenait…", "t": 16.479}, {"w": "dans", "t": 17.068}, {"w": "le", "t": 17.294}, {"w": "temps", "t": 17.43}, {"w": "d'un", "t": 17.702}, {"w": "café", "t": 17.928}, {"w": "?", "t": 18.155}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "CivRebar AI dessine les barres, les cadres, les cotes et les repères.", "t0": 18.58, "t1": 23.512, "words": [{"w": "CivRebar", "t": 18.58}, {"w": "AI", "t": 19.243}, {"w": "dessine", "t": 19.463}, {"w": "les", "t": 20.052}, {"w"